    "https://converse.isolvedhire.com/jobs/1873775": {
      "title": "Adjunct in Physics",
      "description": "Adjunct in Physics - Spartanburg, SC - Converse University Jobs Jobs Login Back to all jobs Adjunct in Physics 580 East Main Street, Spartanburg, SC, USA Seasonal Email Me Similar Jobs Email Me This Job Physics Instruction The Department of Natural Science is looking for an individual to teach both lecture and lab for second semester physics (algebra-based) during Spring, 2027, which begins on January 13. The class involves 3 hours of lecture and 3 hours of lab each week. Labs must be face-to-face. The class is currently scheduled in the daytime with MWF lectures from 1:30-2:20 and labs on Thursday from 9:00-12:00 and 2:30-5:30. The schedule can be adjusted for appropriate candidates. The individual will have full course responsibility, including creation of the syllabus, determining the labs, and setting up the lab exercises. Qualifications include a masters degree in Physics and teaching experience. Applications should include a CV/resume, letter of application, and a list of at least 3 references. Applications will be accepted until the position is filled. Selected candidates must complete a background check that is satisfactory to the University and be qualified to teach in the US. This position is ineligible for immigration sponsorship. Apply now How would you like to verify your identity? Continue with phone Verify with a one-time text code Continue with email Verify with a one-time code Powered by iSolved Talent Acquisition Sign Up For Job Alerts! Name You must type a name. Email You must type a valid email. Location (city, state or zip code) You must select a location. Accept Terms of Service I agree to the terms of service and privacy policy. You must accept the terms of service and privacy policy. Send Me Jobs Would you like Refer.io to send you similar jobs from other employers? Yes, daily! Yes, weekly! No, thanks. Please type the job title you are interested in: Job title You must type a job title. We'll send some jobs to you in the